          "boundary": "blank_line",
          "sentence_terminated": false,
          "qualification": "unconfirmed",
          "characters": 29,
          "public_text": "这一小步的目标是——先不写链表，掌握两个必备的 C语法点："
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "sha256": "c237e4177bd37dbacfecf0848d5b0db786dc0154d3ba5ff2ea7c905b1a293ef8",
          "first_token_ns": 415055388827166,
          "completed_ns": 415055521301166,
          "boundary": "blank_line",
          "sentence_terminated": true,
          "qualification": "unconfirmed",
          "characters": 64,
          "public_text": "1. **用箭头 `->`通过指针访问结构体成员**2. **用 `malloc` / `free`在堆上创建和释放“结点”**"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "sha256": "29bd4adb1aae42052ec064fcd7043a82edc595ae7c0fc0b3226e773bf7f184bc",
          "first_token_ns": 415055521417041,
          "completed_ns": 415055891845791,
          "boundary": "blank_line",
          "sentence_terminated": false,
          "qualification": "unconfirmed",
          "characters": 9,
          "public_text": "先看一段最小代码："
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "sha256": "de2d9fd127a272dbad7859350d5b39bbeaa7c0816f3234eb54575245e758174d",
          "first_token_ns": 415056109415958,
          "completed_ns": 415056145071208,
          "boundary": "blank_line",
          "sentence_terminated": false,
          "qualification": "unconfirmed",
          "characters": 10,
          "public_text": "**关键点对照：**"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "sha256": "9a5a18459f2aa386820d67ce800a647c09cd829ff1fb6c0836e699cde575f799",
          "first_token_ns": 415056145167666,
          "completed_ns": 415056668611541,
          "boundary": "blank_line",
          "sentence_terminated": true,
          "qualification": "unconfirmed",
          "characters": 295,
          "public_text": "|写法 |含义 |\n|---|---|\n| `p->data` |通过指针 `p`访问它指向的结构体的 `data`成员，等价于 `(*p).data` |\n| `p->next` |通过指针 `p`访问它指向的结构体的 `next`成员 |\n| `malloc(sizeof(struct Node))` |在堆上分配足够存一个 `struct Node`的内存，返回 `void *`，需要转换成 `struct Node *` |\n| `free(p)` |释放 `p`指向的堆内存；释放后不要再用 `p`解引用 |\n| `p = NULL` |避免悬空指针，防止误用已释放的内存 |"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "sha256": "2a531b34c613b935ab2013c5474c2e2fe755ccc3120db49d9d5c19e16d584e41",
          "first_token_ns": 415056668780125,
          "completed_ns": 415056787407791,
          "boundary": "blank_line",
          "sentence_terminated": false,
          "qualification": "unconfirmed",
          "characters": 21,
          "public_text": "再强调一下**变量框和指向对象**的区别："
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "sha256": "d488554d686984b8efdc26ed24280c979ea60b72ad00659771fe72f575c667ae",
          "first_token_ns": 415057330968250,
          "completed_ns": 415057343696958,
          "boundary": "blank_line",
          "sentence_terminated": false,
          "qualification": "unconfirmed",
          "characters": 45,
          "public_text": "struct Node *b = malloc(sizeof(struct Node));"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "sha256": "db13288cb8e0998768e59a8fdeaec1215b5dec61c11324dd71a9f396771fdd6f",
          "first_token_ns": 415057377726083,
          "completed_ns": 415057655800291,
          "boundary": "blank_line",
          "sentence_terminated": true,
          "qualification": "unconfirmed",
          "characters": 188,
          "public_text": "a->data =1;\na->next = b; // a的 next指向 bb->data =2;\nb->next = NULL; // b是最后一个结点//从 a出发遍历struct Node *cur = a;\nwhile (cur != NULL) {\n printf(\"%d \", cur->data);\n cur = cur->next;\n}\n//输出:12```"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "sha256": "0006ef38dc7d258df4ceb2c88758bb47986a106b632a8c113e6ea11ee23aed8a",
          "first_token_ns": 415057655880291,
          "completed_ns": 415057979124500,
          "boundary": "temporary_stream_end",
          "sentence_terminated": true,
          "qualification": "unconfirmed",
          "characters": 78,
          "public_text": "到这里，单链表的两个语法前提——**箭头访问**和**动态结点**——就已经齐了。下一步就可以把“创建结点、连成链、遍历、插入、删除”正式组织成链表的操作。"
        }
      ],
