          "qualification": "unconfirmed",
          "characters": 115,
          "public_text": "先看一个最小的 C单链表节点和建表代码。它的前置知识主要是：结构体、指针、动态内存分配，以及“指针存的是地址”这件事。下面这段代码会显式打印每个节点的地址、`next`里存的地址，以及它指向谁，方便你把“箭头”和“地址标签”对上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "sha256": "8a6c5a805f8f033ca03047afd3c274a4553152572515ae83bbd44f84d12d39a1",
          "first_token_ns": 415074314085708,
          "completed_ns": 415074314143458,
          "boundary": "blank_line",
          "sentence_terminated": false,
          "qualification": "unconfirmed",
          "characters": 5,
          "public_text": "观察重点："
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "sha256": "fa267729964115031b13615abd8cefd89eaadf9cc4a801df625c40d2b39ea571",
          "first_token_ns": 415074314192958,
          "completed_ns": 415074784636875,
          "boundary": "blank_line",
          "sentence_terminated": true,
          "qualification": "unconfirmed",
          "characters": 208,
          "public_text": "1. `Node *head`是变量框，里面放地址。\n2. `n1`、`n2`、`n3`分别指向 `malloc`出来的节点对象。\n3. `n1->next = n2`表示把 `n2`的地址写进 `n1`的 `next`字段里，于是 `n1`的箭头指向 `n2`。\n4. `head = n1`表示头指针指向第一个节点。\n5. `cur = cur->next`就是沿着 `next`里保存的地址往后走到下一个节点。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "sha256": "f293e8c0df4d67c65b9d65bc197a422b36c20ae2a67de1eedae0484752b30dea",
          "first_token_ns": 415074784681458,
          "completed_ns": 415074787056416,
          "boundary": "temporary_stream_end",
          "sentence_terminated": true,
          "qualification": "unconfirmed",
          "characters": 45,
          "public_text": "如果你愿意，我可以接着把这段代码按“变量框 /对象框 /箭头”画成内存示意图，再逐行解释。"
        }
      ],
